<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_903_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230822__20230822_zASBgSBVYZhb"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-08-22" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span>&#160;</p>

